+    // NX2Apple: certificates are checked (they were accepted unchecked, so anyone on the network could
+    // stand in for the server). This client talks to the anisette server, which the system's roots
+    // vouch for, and to Apple's provisioning hosts (gsa.apple.com), whose chain ends in Apple Root CA,
+    // which Windows does not trust by default: the system's roots plus Apple's, as plume_core's client()
     Ok(ClientBuilder::new()
         .http1_title_case_headers()
